{"id":"n50006-1-6","stage":4,"title":"등골 · 脊梁骨","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50006-1-6-1","ko":"오늘 날씨가 갑자기 더워졌어.","zh":"今天天气突然变热了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"더워졌어.","meaning":"热，暑；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더워졌어","audio":"/audio/b72d5dd263b423edd97c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06f0996f9e763703483c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50006-1-6-2","ko":"그러게 말이야. 등골에도 땀이 흘러내릴 정도로 덥네.","zh":"是啊，热得连后背都冒汗呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"등골에도","meaning":"脊梁骨，脊椎","explanation":"등골：脊梁骨，脊椎；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"등골","audio":"/audio/cd922c5807ad0533fa87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50006","senseId":"1","lemma":"등골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등골에도","audio":"/audio/db04afa384fba75fcf73.mp3"}},{"text":"땀이","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땀이","audio":"/audio/e4dfc30a9272ce66af55.mp3"}},{"text":"흘러내릴","meaning":"流下来","explanation":"흘러내리다：流下来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"흘러내리다","audio":"/audio/f941cff89c5ca68e1fea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89255","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘러내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘러내릴","audio":"/audio/cfeef2850063497beec1.mp3"}},{"text":"정도로","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도로","audio":"/audio/ec305014b1a4cd03a44c.mp3"}},{"text":"덥네.","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덥네","audio":"/audio/11567a8dce49f526197e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"cd922c5807ad0533","term":"등골","zh":"脊梁骨，脊椎","audio":"/audio/cd922c5807ad0533fa87.mp3","entryId":"50006","definition":"人体后背中间长长的部分。","pronunciation":["등꼴"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"f941cff89c5ca68e","term":"흘러내리다","zh":"流下来","audio":"/audio/f941cff89c5ca68e1fea.mp3","entryId":"89255","definition":"水等从高处向低处流或掉落。","pronunciation":["흘러내리다"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definit